# P113 on Android: Back (the key row `back`) must not close a window that is not closable, and must once "closable" is on.
# Pass, read from logcat: "SCUI-WindowBehaviors: Back ignored" twice (the main window, then the second window), then
# "closable=true" for the second window and the second window gone after the third Back, then "closable=true" for the
# main window; the final capture is the launcher, because the last Back, with the main window closable, sends the app
# to the background. Rows press by text, so they hold on any AVD. Written 2026-10-28 on swift-cross-ui-api36b.
# P113 在 Android 上：返回(按鍵列 `back`)不能關閉不可關閉的視窗，打開「closable」後則要關閉。通過(讀 logcat):
# 「SCUI-WindowBehaviors: Back ignored」兩次(主視窗、第二個視窗),接著第二個視窗「closable=true」、第三次返回後第二個視窗
# 消失，再來主視窗「closable=true」;最終擷圖是 launcher,因為最後一次返回時主視窗可關閉,app 被送到背景。以文字按壓，
# 任何 AVD 都適用。2026-10-28 寫於 swift-cross-ui-api36b。
